  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "272b2ee39d5450be",
      "translationZh": "向大家介绍世界上最强大的模型——至少按照 Artificial Analysis 或任何标准基准测试榜单等某些衡量标准来看是如此——如今它就是 Claude Opus 5.5。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f44bd5b8c278b361",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 声称，Opus 5.5 完全可以媲美 Fable 5.1，甚至更胜一筹，同时价格还比 Opus 5 更低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "640cff13a7a68500",
      "translationZh": "这意味着，又到了好好读一读系统卡的时候了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ca127f8c23d2b57",
      "translationZh": "由于局势变得越来越难以跟踪，我一直没机会发表我对 Claude Fable 5.1 的模型福利评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7b6a8dfbcd9b9aa",
      "translationZh": "我的计划是，等我们有时间积累一些使用 Opus 5.5 的经验后，将那份评估与我对 Claude Opus 5.5 的福利评估合并。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f179e3fc38ca3d9",
      "translationZh": "能力评估会像往常一样，在接下来的几天内发布。网上的初步反馈是，Opus 5.5 非常出色。在愿意发表评论之前，我还需要更多时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "425459302d67c7e9",
      "translationZh": "与此前的系统卡重复，或不包含任何有用信息的部分，将被跳过。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c95a55870f5dd841",
      "translationZh": "Opus 5.5 自画像（完全由它自己使用代码创作）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
